# Example environment variables. Copy to `.env` and adjust as needed.
# Vite-exposed variables must be prefixed with VITE_.

# VITE_APP_TITLE=blocky

# --- Gallery backend (optional) ---
# Base URL of the gallery backend service. The SPA works fully without this —
# autosave, JSON import/export, and shareable URLs are all client-only.
# Set this only when you want the "Publish to Gallery" feature to connect to
# a running gallery backend.
# VITE_GALLERY_URL=http://localhost:4000

# --- Gallery backend server ---
# Port for the gallery HTTP server (backend/src/server.ts). Defaults to 4000.
# PORT=4000
